00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:20,000
Just read some articles about victorious serial killers.

230
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:24,000
I mean, of course, if you're convinced, you don't have to actually read them.

231
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:29,000
And again, it's only in recent years that people do this stuff.

